# NEGATIVE fixture for gates/050_capability_requires_realization.rq (FIRES it):
# a fully-conformed capability declaration (all required contract fields present)
# with ZERO dcp:Realization bindings -- a Plan the resolver could never select a
# provider for. Expected: 050 returns >= 1 row naming ex:neg-noreal-cap.

ex:neg-noreal-cap a dcp:DomainCapability ;
